course: dictionary
lesson: 4334
title: Grunt: a sound with a meaning
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A grunt is a short, low sound made deep in your throat. Grunt can be a verb (to grunt) or a noun (a grunt), and the context tells you which one. In «The baby grunts, and Alice tells it, "Don't grunt, that's not at all a proper way of expressing yourself."», the baby is making the sound, and Alice says it is not a proper way to talk.
explain: Look for clues. Pigs grunt, and people grunt when they lift something heavy or when they are tired or grumpy. So when a character grunts, they are usually making a sound instead of using proper words. Ask yourself: what is happening in the story right now?
fact: To grunt is to make a short, low sound in your throat, like a pig.
fact: A grunt is that sound itself, as in «H'm!» grunted by Badger.
fact: «Grunt work» means boring, hard work.
fact: Pigs use more than twenty different grunts and squeals.
exercise: «Pigs use more than twenty different grunts and squeals.» In this sentence, what is a grunt? | A kind of tall tree | A type of hat | *A short, low sound, like the sound a pig makes | A long, sweet song
exercise: Tennis players grunt when they hit the ball very hard. Why might a grunt show effort? | *It shows they are straining with effort | It shows they have finished the game | It shows they are singing | It shows they are bored
exercise: «"Company," he grunts, and turns his back and disappears.» Copy the one word that shows he makes a sound rather than speaking clearly. | back | disappears | turns | *grunts
test: Dad lifted the heavy box and grunted. What does grunted show? | He was asleep | He was reading a book aloud | He was dancing | *He was straining with effort
test: In slang, what is a grunt? | A kind of bird | *A low-ranking soldier or worker who does hard, boring jobs | A large hat | A famous singer
exam: «The baby grunts, and Alice tells it, "Don't grunt, that's not at all a proper way of expressing yourself."» What is Alice's point? | Alice is a pig | *Grunting is not a proper way of expressing yourself | Babies cannot make any sounds | Grunting is the best way to talk
